# The website (anyplay-gg/web) on the cloud's host name: the landing page at the root, the sign-in,
# sign-up and account pages and the files they load. Every other path, the APIs and the older pages
# under /web included, stays with the cloud; the older account page sends people to the new one.
@website path / /sign-in /create /account /account/* /_next/* /icon.svg /favicon.ico
handle @website {
	reverse_proxy web:3000
}
redir /web/account /account 302
